+# Customer Admin Console
+
+An internal-tool style customer administration screen: dense sortable table,
+multi-select with bulk actions, filters, and pagination over a generated
+220-row mock dataset.
+
+## Stack
+
+- React 19 + TypeScript
+- Vite 8 (build tool)
+- Tailwind CSS v4 (utility styling, no component kit)
+
+## Scripts
+
+```bash
+npm install
+npm run dev       # dev server
+npm run build     # tsc -b && vite build
+npm run preview   # serve the production build locally
+npm run lint      # oxlint
+```
+
+See `.eval/worker-report.md` for the engineering handoff notes (design
+reasoning, verification performed, known gaps).
